{%- comment -%}
  Live placeholder-art preview: a tinted SVG shirt outline with the uploaded
  logo overlaid. Rendered in the main product gallery in place of the "coming
  soon" placeholder when there's no real product photography yet and shirt
  design is enabled — JS keeps it in sync with the color swatches/logo input
  in the shirt-designer snippet elsewhere on the page.
  Params: color (initial color value)
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="shirt-preview" data-shirt-preview style="--shirt-color: {{ color | escape }};">
  <svg class="shirt-preview__svg" viewBox="0 0 200 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <path d="M55,15 L15,45 L35,80 L35,205 L165,205 L165,80 L185,45 L145,15 L100,55 Z" />
  </svg>
  <img class="shirt-preview__logo" data-shirt-logo-preview hidden alt="" width="200" height="200">
</div>
